{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cool summer breeze, fluffy clouds and singing birds. What could be more beautiful?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 that's what Marfa the cat thought, basking in the sun on the windowsill of the Artist's house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is an Artist? This is Marfa's owner. He works hard, but not only on his paintings, but also... on a mysterious plan. What is this plan? \u2014 you may ask. The answer to this question is what the kitty Marfa is looking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976120/extras/df930a1dde908ba823fb5e4f0962d3ff.avif?t=1739973820\" width=612 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path to the solution will turn the life of a simple home cat upside down, open up a new mysteriously scary world ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of world is this, what secrets the city hides and why the Artist fails to carry out his plan - that's what you have to find out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976120/extras/4086495b0bf06fcd942e020c69c4115c.avif?t=1739973820\" width=612 height=287 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to look at the city with the big eyes of a charming cat, feel both the beauty of the world and look at it through a terrifying prism, learn a lot of new things, untangle a tangle of secrets and riddles and help the Artist bring to life the plan of an ideal city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >They are waiting for you:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Exciting puzzles in the Point-and-Click quest genre;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interesting tasks and important cat chores;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A fascinating story and incredible adventures;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New knowledge and amazing facts;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Aerial watercolor painting</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And, of course, a very cute cat Marfa!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CREATED WITH THE SUPPORT OF THE INNOVATION PROMOTION FUND</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2976120?t=1739973820","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739973820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976120/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739973820","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976120/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739973820","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cool summer breeze, fluffy clouds and singing birds. What could be more beautiful?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 that's what Marfa the cat thought, basking in the sun on the windowsill of the Artist's house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is an Artist? This is Marfa's owner. He works hard, but not only on his paintings, but also... on a mysterious plan. What is this plan? \u2014 you may ask. The answer to this question is what the kitty Marfa is looking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976120/extras/df930a1dde908ba823fb5e4f0962d3ff.avif?t=1739973820\" width=612 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path to the solution will turn the life of a simple home cat upside down, open up a new mysteriously scary world ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of world is this, what secrets the city hides and why the Artist fails to carry out his plan - that's what you have to find out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976120/extras/4086495b0bf06fcd942e020c69c4115c.avif?t=1739973820\" width=612 height=287 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to look at the city with the big eyes of a charming cat, feel both the beauty of the world and look at it through a terrifying prism, learn a lot of new things, untangle a tangle of secrets and riddles and help the Artist bring to life the plan of an ideal city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >They are waiting for you:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Exciting puzzles in the Point-and-Click quest genre;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interesting tasks and important cat chores;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A fascinating story and incredible adventures;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New knowledge and amazing facts;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Aerial watercolor painting</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And, of course, a very cute cat Marfa!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CREATED WITH THE SUPPORT OF THE INNOVATION PROMOTION FUND</p>","developers":["Sarra Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976120/header.jpg?t=